# Staging test-account provisioning (scripts/staging/) -- credentials and
# recovery manifests must never be committed, regardless of where the
# operator points --credentials-file/--manifest-file. These patterns are
# defense in depth; the scripts themselves default to writing OUTSIDE this
# repository entirely.
*.staging-credentials.json
*.staging-manifest.json
staging-credentials*.json
staging-manifest*.json
